---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Compound Health | A private longevity membership, introduced through your advisor, firm or organization"
  description="A private longevity membership introduced through wealth advisors, employers, and executive networks. Diagnostics, continuous tracking, and personalized protocols from curated clinical partners. Your health data stays yours."
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        class="hero-img"
        src="/images/hero-landscape.webp"
        alt=""
        width="1536"
        height="1024"
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <a href="#joinwaitlist" class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>Founding member waitlist now open</a>
      <h1>Beyond wealth:<br />the years to <em>enjoy it</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        A private longevity membership, introduced through the people who already advise you, your
        firm or your organization. Delivered by clinical partners chosen against one standard. Your
        data stays yours.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <div class="hero-btns">
          <a href="#joinwaitlist" class="btn-solid">Get access</a>
          <a href="#how" class="btn-outline">See how it works &#8594;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-note">
          <a href="#partners" class="link-quiet">
            Introducing Compound Health to your clients, employees or members?
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CREDIBILITY BAR -->
  <div class="credbar">
    <span class="cred-label">Where we are</span>
    <div class="cred-item">
      <span class="cred-num">400</span>
      <span class="cred-text">UHNW clients in the advisory book we delivered our first session to</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cred-divider"></div>
    <div class="cred-item">
      <span class="cred-num">May 2026</span>
      <span class="cred-text">First educational session with a global private bank advisory team</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cred-divider"></div>
    <div class="cred-item">
      <span class="cred-num">1</span>
      <span class="cred-text">Healthspan score, owned by the client</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="how" id="how">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="s-head reveal">
        <p class="s-chip">The process</p>
        <div class="s-head-copy">
          <h2 class="s-title">A new model for<br />human performance</h2>
          <p class="s-sub">
            We built the infrastructure that connects the people who advise you to world-class
            preventive care.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="s-head-action">
          <a href="#features" class="btn-pill">What you get &#8594;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="steps reveal">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-n">01</div>
          <div class="step-title">Join through your advisor, firm or organization</div>
          <p>
            Access Compound Health as a benefit through a relationship you already have. No cold
            starts. No separate onboarding.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-n">02</div>
          <div class="step-title">Deep diagnostic intake</div>
          <p>
            A comprehensive baseline: advanced bloodwork, imaging, genetic risk, cognitive and
            metabolic assessments. Not a wellness check. A full-picture biological audit by elite
            clinicians.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-n">03</div>
          <div class="step-title">Personalized longevity plan</div>
          <p>
            Your clinical team, chosen for this program, and a dedicated health concierge build
            and actively manage a protocol tailored to your data, goals, and lifestyle.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT YOU GET
       Bento grid: one tall cell carries the product surface, the rest carry a
       line icon, a title and a sentence. Deliberately not the two-column
       product pattern used by 'How we choose' below, so the two sections do
       not read as the same section twice. -->
  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="s-head reveal">
        <p class="s-chip">What you get</p>
        <div class="s-head-copy">
          <h2 class="s-title">Everything your health<br />has been missing</h2>
          <p class="s-sub">
            Compound Health is not a gym membership or a supplement subscription. It is a medical
            relationship, sustained and personalized.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="s-head-action">
          <a href="#membership" class="btn-pill">See membership &#8594;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bento reveal">
        <div class="bento-cell is-surface">
          <div>
            <span class="bento-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 4v16h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M8 14l3-4 3 3 4-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg></span>
            <h3 class="bento-title">A dashboard for your body</h3>
            <p>
              The same rigor your advisor applies to your portfolio, applied to your biology.
              Track trends, understand risks, and act on what the data reveals.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-card">
            <div class="stack-card-head">Health score overview</div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-name">Cardiovascular</span>
              <div class="metric-track"><div class="metric-fill is-good" style="width:82%"></div></div>
              <span class="metric-val">82</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-name">Metabolic</span>
              <div class="metric-track"><div class="metric-fill is-warn" style="width:74%"></div></div>
              <span class="metric-val">74</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-name">Cognitive</span>
              <div class="metric-track"><div class="metric-fill is-good" style="width:91%"></div></div>
              <span class="metric-val">91</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-name">Hormonal</span>
              <div class="metric-track"><div class="metric-fill is-warn" style="width:67%"></div></div>
              <span class="metric-val">67</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-name">Sleep quality</span>
              <div class="metric-track"><div class="metric-fill is-good" style="width:88%"></div></div>
              <span class="metric-val">88</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-cell is-half">
          <span class="bento-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 3v5a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M3.5 3h2M11 3h2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M9 16v1a4 4 0 0 0 8 0v-1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <circle cx="18" cy="13.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              </svg></span>
          <h3 class="bento-title">Curated clinical delivery</h3>
          <p>
            Physician-led care nationwide, virtual and in person, from partners selected for
            outcomes, governance, and data ownership. Logistics handled.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-cell is-half">
          <span class="bento-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 3c0 4 10 5 10 9s-10 5-10 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M17 3c0 4-10 5-10 9s10 5 10 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M8.5 6.5h7M7 12h10M8.5 17.5h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg></span>
          <h3 class="bento-title">Full biomarker tracking</h3>
          <p>
            Multiple comprehensive panels per year, DEXA, full performance battery, CGM cycles, and
            continuous wearable integration, all synthesized into a single health intelligence layer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-cell is-half">
          <span class="bento-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="2.8" y="8.2" width="18.4" height="7.6" rx="3.8" transform="rotate(-45 12 12)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M9.3 9.3l5.4 5.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg></span>
          <h3 class="bento-title">Personalized protocols</h3>
          <p>
            Calibrated to your biology, not a template.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-cell is-wide">
          <span class="bento-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 17h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M5 17a7 7 0 0 1 14 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M12 7V5M10.5 5h3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg></span>
          <h3 class="bento-title">Health concierge</h3>
          <p>
            A dedicated coordinator who handles specialist referrals, appointment logistics, second
            opinions, and anything else between you and better health.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW WE CHOOSE
       The three disciplines are a tablist. Choosing one swaps the card in the
       panel and marks the row in the card behind it. Every line inside the
       panel is a phrase from that discipline's own paragraph. -->
  <section class="curated prod">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="s-head reveal">
        <p class="s-chip">How we choose</p>
        <div class="s-head-copy">
          <h2 class="s-title">The best of each discipline,<br />one membership</h2>
          <p class="s-sub">
            Longevity medicine is not one company. We assessed the field, set one standard, and
            chose the partners who meet it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prod-grid" id="disciplines">
        <div class="prod-list reveal" role="tablist" aria-label="Disciplines">
          <button class="prod-item" type="button" role="tab" id="tab-clinical"
                  aria-controls="pane-clinical" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">
            <span class="prod-item-head">
              <span class="prod-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 3v5a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M3.5 3h2M11 3h2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M9 16v1a4 4 0 0 0 8 0v-1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <circle cx="18" cy="13.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              </svg></span>
              <span class="prod-title">Clinical care</span>
            </span>
            <span class="prod-copy">Physician-led teams with published outcomes and continuous care between visits.</span>
          </button>
          <button class="prod-item" type="button" role="tab" id="tab-diagnostics"
                  aria-controls="pane-diagnostics" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
            <span class="prod-item-head">
              <span class="prod-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                  <path d="M4 8V5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 4H8M16 4h2.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 20 5.5V8M20 16v2.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H16M8 20H5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 18.5V16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                </svg></span>
              <span class="prod-title">Diagnostics and screening</span>
            </span>
            <span class="prod-copy">
              Baseline testing, multi-cancer early detection and imaging, chosen for accuracy and
              usefulness.
            </span>
          </button>
          <button class="prod-item" type="button" role="tab" id="tab-therapies"
                  aria-controls="pane-therapies" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
            <span class="prod-item-head">
              <span class="prod-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="2.8" y="8.2" width="18.4" height="7.6" rx="3.8" transform="rotate(-45 12 12)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M9.3 9.3l5.4 5.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg></span>
              <span class="prod-title">Advanced therapies</span>
            </span>
            <span class="prod-copy">
              Hormones, peptides, and regenerative therapies, only when your data indicates them,
              only through vetted sourcing.
            </span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="prod-panel reveal">
          <div class="prod-panes">
            <div class="prod-pane is-active" id="pane-clinical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-clinical">
              <div class="stack-card">
                <div class="stack-card-head">One standard</div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Physician-led teams
              </div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Published outcomes
              </div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Continuous care between visits
              </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="prod-pane" id="pane-diagnostics" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-diagnostics">
              <div class="stack-card">
                <div class="stack-card-head">One standard</div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Baseline testing
              </div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Multi-cancer early detection
              </div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Imaging
              </div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Accuracy and usefulness
              </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="prod-pane" id="pane-therapies" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-therapies">
              <div class="stack-card">
                <div class="stack-card-head">One standard</div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Hormones, peptides, and regenerative therapies
              </div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Only when your data indicates them
              </div>
              <div class="stack-row" style="padding:9px 0;">
                <span class="stack-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l4.5 4.5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                Vetted sourcing
              </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-back" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="stack-row is-active" data-back="clinical"><span class="stack-mark"></span>Clinical care</div>
            <div class="stack-row" data-back="diagnostics"><span class="stack-mark"></span>Diagnostics and screening</div>
            <div class="stack-row" data-back="therapies"><span class="stack-mark"></span>Advanced therapies</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="curated-note reveal">
        Every partner is re-reviewed each year. If a better option emerges, the membership moves
        with it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <!-- PARTNERS (formerly Case study) -->
  <section class="case" id="partners">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="s-head reveal">
        <p class="s-chip">Partners</p>
        <div class="s-head-copy">
          <h2 class="s-title">A credible way to bring longevity<br />to the people you serve</h2>
          <p class="s-sub">
            Compound Health is introduced, not sold. Whether you advise clients, employ a
            workforce or lead a network, you make the introduction and we run the program.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Proof block: the first partner engagement, kept as evidence -->
      <div class="case-stats reveal">
        <div class="case-stat">
          <div class="case-num">400</div>
          <div class="case-stat-label">UHNW clients in the advisory team's book, reached through a single educational session.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-stat">
          <div class="case-num"><em>First</em></div>
          <div class="case-stat-label">Educational session of its kind delivered with a private bank advisory team.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-stat">
          <div class="case-num">May '26</div>
          <div class="case-stat-label">From first conversation to delivered session in days, not quarters.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-content is-narrow reveal">
        <h3 class="case-title">What we delivered</h3>
        <ul class="case-agenda">
          <li>The health data worth paying attention to, and what to ignore</li>
          <li>The tests and metrics that matter in each decade of life</li>
          <li>High-impact habits for busy professionals and entrepreneurs</li>
          <li>How to support aging parents alongside your own health</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="audience-grid reveal">
        <div class="audience-tile">
          <span class="audience-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9.5 12 4l9 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M5.5 10.5v8.5M18.5 10.5v8.5M10 10.5v8.5M14 10.5v8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M3.5 20h17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="audience-title">Wealth firms</h3>
          <p>
            RIAs, family offices, and private bank teams. A client session first, then membership
            your clients join through you.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-tile">
          <span class="audience-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7.5" width="18" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M9 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M3 12.5h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="audience-title">Employers</h3>
          <p>
            Self-insured employers and leadership teams. Clinical outcomes on health spend, from
            the C-suite to the wider organization.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-tile">
          <span class="audience-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8.5" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M3.5 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M16 5.8a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M17.2 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-2-4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="audience-title">Executive and peer networks</h3>
          <p>
            CEO groups, professional networks, sports and entertainment organizations. A shared
            baseline for your members and results you can publish.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-tile">
          <span class="audience-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5 12 4l8 6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M6 10v10h12V10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M10 20v-5.5h4V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h3 class="audience-title">Family offices and households</h3>
          <p>
            One program across generations, with each member owning their own data.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="partner-notes reveal">
        <div class="partner-note">
          <div class="partner-note-title">Structured for you</div>
          <p>Tiers and terms are set with each partner, so the program fits the people it serves.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="partner-note">
          <div class="partner-note-title">Nothing crosses the line</div>
          <p>Health data belongs to the individual. You see engagement, never medical information.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="partner-note">
          <div class="partner-note-title">Introduced, not sold</div>
          <p>Your people join through you. You are never the intermediary for care or data.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="partner-cta reveal">
        <a href="#joinwaitlist" class="btn-solid" data-wf-role="partner">Talk to us about a program</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <!-- MEMBERSHIP (formerly Plans) -->
  <section class="plans" id="membership">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="s-head reveal">
        <p class="s-chip">Membership</p>
        <div class="s-head-copy">
          <h2 class="s-title">Built for founders, executives, and families.<br />Structured for the organizations that serve them.</h2>
          <p class="plans-lead">One way in. Two ways forward.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="s-head-action">
          <a href="#joinwaitlist" class="btn-pill">Get access &#8594;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="plans-grid reveal">
        <div class="plan">
          <div class="plan-name">Baseline</div>
          <p class="plan-price-note">Credited toward year one if you continue.</p>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>Advanced and standard bloodwork, mobile-drawn at home</li>
